            "result": "\\(z_B=e^{-i\\pi/4}\\)."
          },
          {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "حساب z_A/z_B",
            "explanation": "\\[\n\\frac{z_A}{z_B}\n=\\frac{e^{i\\pi/4}}{e^{-i\\pi/4}}\n=e^{i(\\pi/4+\\pi/4)}\n=e^{i\\pi/2}.\n\\]",
            "result": "\\(\\frac{z_A}{z_B}=e^{i\\pi/2}\\)."
