        "final_answer": "\\[\n\\boxed{z_A=e^{i\\pi/4}},\\qquad\n\\boxed{z_B=e^{-i\\pi/4}},\\qquad\n\\boxed{\\frac{z_A}{z_B}=e^{i\\pi/2}}.\n\\]",
